OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fsettled night with mostly cloudy
OL,7,Fskies, though some clear intervals are
OL,8,Fpossible. Winds strengthening around
OL,9,Fcoastal areas of Argyll, but lighter
OL,10,Fwinds inland where a little chilly.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA dry and mostly cloudy
OL,13,Fmorning with some brightness. Cloud
OL,14,Flowering and becoming thicker in the
OL,15,Fafternoon with some light rain
OL,16,Fpossible. Winds strengthening, with
OL,17,Fcoastal gales possible in west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
